/* ══════════ report-builder shell — v9 (Mixpanel-like) / v10 (Amplitude-like) ══════════
   One shell, one VARIANT flag. The query builder (rb-engine-v9.js + the page's inline layer)
   is shared; this file owns what the two references do differently:
   where a saved report lives, how dashboards/boards behave, sharing, history, filters.

   Variant behaviour (comparison matrix — also recorded in versions.js):
   ┌──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┐
   │                          │ v9  (mixpanel)                   │ v10 (amplitude)                     │
   ├──────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────┤
   │ a saved report lives in  │ a board (board = folder)         │ a space / folder, on its own        │
   │ same report, 2nd board   │ linked copy (edits everywhere)   │ once per dashboard; copy = independent│
   │ dashboard filter         │ temporary per viewer + pin       │ parameters + Save onto charts       │
   │ organization             │ Pinned · Favorites · Your boards │ Spaces · All content · search       │
   │ trust signal             │ admin Pin + project home board   │ Official badge                      │
   │ collaboration            │ comments + version history       │ description + revert                │
   │ create dashboard         │ empty board + Add                │ "what story…" start screen          │
   │ public sharing           │ public board + passcode + embed  │ public link + expiry + password     │
   └──────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────┘ */
